    title: "spec_validator has no dangling-endpoint check: 23 src-dangling edges pass clean (authoritative 110533-edge endpoint-integrity table: 72.75% both-real / 27.23% placeholder-dst / 0.02% src-dangling / 0% dst-dangling)"  # 4988
